      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>Deposits</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>from the hand of the exemplar of the great and support of</p>\n<p>the notables, of power and renown, his excellency</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>our master the noble ami\u0304r al-H\u0323a\u0304jj \u02bfUmar Agha, supervisor of the silk looms for the port of Alexandria. That [amount]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>was collected by Ibra\u0304hi\u0304m, the gatekeeper of Waka\u0304lat al- Bi\u0304t\u0323a\u0304sh, as his salary, registered</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>in the Bureau of Silk Looms in the aforementioned port for the month of Juma\u0304d[a\u0304 al-]A\u0304khir, the year 1239, thirty-nine [~ February 1824].</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
